2252 0 obj
  << /ActualText (EDI Ingestion Engine\072 Parses test and CFD simulation CSV files\054 normalizing all measurements into a consistent format\056\n\nOffline Product Catalog\072 Embeds the full product catalog and test data directly in the app\056\n\nRegression Engine\072 Fits four model types to pressure drop data and scores each fit for cross\055product comparison\056\n\nCatalog Data Service\072 Provides all screens with fast\054 searchable access to the full product catalog\056\n\nApplication Interface\072 Dashboard\054 product catalog\054 multi\055product regression comparison with BOM tree and Emerson IAS links\054 and drag\055and\055drop data import\056\n\nReport Generation Engine\072 Exports analysis results as a formatted Word document with charts and product specs\056\n\nAutomated Release Pipeline\072 Engineers import test and BOM data directly in\055app\056 Version tags trigger automated builds and publish verified installers\056)
     /K [ 30 ]
     /P 2253 0 R
     /Pg 2192 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
