2292 0 obj
  << /ActualText (ArrestorIQ replaces fragmented spreadsheet workflows with a purpose\055built platform for Emerson\047s flame arrestor product line\056 By unifying data ingestion\054 multi\055product regression analysis\054 and direct access to engineering master data\054 it gives engineers faster insights with greater confidence and stays maintainable long after the project concludes\056 \n\nLooking ahead\054 future iterations could introduce predictive performance modeling using machine learning trained on historical test data\054 enabling pressure drop predictions for untested configurations and speeding up the design process\056 Custom report templates would allow individual departments to export documents that automatically match their own documentation standards\056 Expanded audit trail support including batch imports and history tracking across products and evaluations would make the platform ready for larger engineering teams\056)
     /K [ 50 ]
     /P 2293 0 R
     /Pg 2192 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

